{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_rope_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_rope_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "鮮花香水",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_rope_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a5ba33de72afd17d03d54a16aea2de2519734df02a27ad0b1ebe2c90150f6ec3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "10:30 A.M.  天氣/晴\n羅德島本艦，四號艙室，療養庭院"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打擾了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打擾了，有人在嗎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒人在呀？你好——你好——請問——有人在嗎——！哈——囉——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，真沒人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可頭疼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空手白來一趟可不是我的作風，哼哼，來都來了，就讓我龍門小飛俠暗索來看看，這裡都有些什麼好東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃，不對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（拍臉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停下，停下，暗索，收斂點，不能這麼幹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（拍臉）（拍臉）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，習慣這東西真可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，沒人在還不鎖門，也太不小心了，就算丟了什麼也不能怪別人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我保證什麼都不拿，就看看，看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來讓我瞧瞧，都有些什麼好東西~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？地上這是什麼......不懂，算了，我跳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嚯嚯，這種花，顏色真好看，不知道值不值錢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，這個設備，很少見耶，應該也挺貴吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有這邊的這片是......藥草？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？嗯嗯？？嗚啊這是什麼味道，好濃郁！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有、有點頭昏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗——哈，好險！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不得了，差點以為要暈過去了，這也太危險了......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怪不得曾經有前輩說過，寧可去撬龍門金庫的鎖，也別闖直接敞開的門，不是沒有道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，玩笑就開到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒人在的話，那就沒辦法了，難得我還想做點好事，算啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來只有下次再來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼，難道偷偷摸摸的還不止我一個呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，有點意思，哪裡來的小賊，讓我們對決一下吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偷偷摸摸......探查敵情，鉤索準備——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晨露，薄荷，碎冰沙♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夕陽，茉莉，蜜糖花~♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼哼~哼~哼哼哼哼~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，打擾一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再加一點培養素，嗯，這個量的話應該沒問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊呀，太專注了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後再和這邊的深層土混合，唔，要不然再多加一點草木灰吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，好像會很不錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（真的完全沒注意到我？安全意識有點差勁哦？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（虧我剛剛還真以為有小偷混進來了，唉。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......平衡性好像還有點不太夠，上次培育也是平衡不穩定出的問題，呼，讓我想想，該怎麼做......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泥炭、赤玉......保持弱酸性......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（還在自言自語，這樣真的沒問題嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（啊，不過，旁邊看著倒是還挺有意思的~）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，我怎麼給忘記了！還可以加入源生地帶回來的砂土試試看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，不管是植物還是人，都是自家才是最好的吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（這話聽起來似乎有點道理。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不過啊，那種好不容易飛出去，完全不想回老家的人、嗯？人？植物？算了沒差別，應該也不少吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，我把那些土壤放到哪裡去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡沒有，也不在這裡，嗯......奇怪了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚哇哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？欸？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暗索",
      "speakerId": "char_236_rope",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "調香師",
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暗索......小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_181_flower",
